+/// WOW-BG3 (local fork, patch 0049): no WoW cinematic in WOW-BG3. A new
+/// WoW character's first login triggers its race intro (a camera fly-by with narration), which in
+/// WOW-BG3 played over BG3's character after a New Game. It is acked at once, as a skip is, so the
+/// server's copy of the flying camera ends too (module doc: unacked, objects stay despawned).
+/// On whenever `$WOW_BG3_LINK_DIR` is set (benilla runs for WOW-BG3), as the other wowbg3 modules.
+fn wowbg3_no_cinematics() -> bool {
+    static ON: std::sync::OnceLock<bool> = std::sync::OnceLock::new();
+    *ON.get_or_init(|| std::env::var_os("WOW_BG3_LINK_DIR").is_some())
+}
